WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.310
OK, let's talk a little bit about masks briefly.

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:07.430
Donald Trump traveled to Arizona yesterday,
went to a Honeywell facility that is making

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:09.639
masks because we have a pandemic.

00:00:09.639 --> 00:00:12.280
And people should be wearing masks.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.730
That factory requires masks.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.730
And Donald Trump refused to wear a mask.

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.320
Instead, Trump wore goggles, which is OK.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.320
I mean, fine.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:24.500
But it's a little weird given that he didn't
wear the mask.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.669
Trump was asked as he was leaving the White
House yesterday on his way to Arizona.

00:00:28.669 --> 00:00:29.930
Will you wear a mask?

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:35.310
And Trump said, I will if it is a mask facility.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:40.920
J. I think it's a bask- facility, right?

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:45.670
If it's a mass facility, I well, yeah, I don't
know if it's a mass facility, but oh, honey,

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.270
you go to see Honeywell.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:50.220
They have done an incredible job on many fronts.

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:54.300
And I'm going to pay my respects to a great
company and a great state.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:58.960
The state of Arizona they make in ninety five.

00:00:58.960 --> 00:00:59.960
Yeah.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.240
They make masks.

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:06.290
As Trump says, if it's a mask facility, Trump
says that he will wear one.

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.450
Well as you can see in this video that we
are playing.

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:15.310
There are safety guidelines prominently displayed
at this Honeywell facility and they say please

00:01:15.310 --> 00:01:21.850
wear your mask at all times in addition to
observing six feet of social distance as well

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:23.990
as using hand sanitizer.

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:31.010
And yet here is Donald Trump standing 18 inches
from another guy wearing goggles, but no mask

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:33.560
as the guy shows him a mask.

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.840
They have a crate of masks in front of them.

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:39.320
You couldn't parody this on Saturday Night
Live.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:45.660
The factory policy is wear a mask at all times
and Trump puts on goggles, but no mask.

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:47.350
And his aides are also not wearing masks.

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:49.560
Now, why do we care about this?

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:51.360
Is it just disaster porn?

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:52.360
No.

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:56.659
We care about this because more than 60 million
people in this country voted for this guy.

00:01:56.659 --> 00:02:00.560
Many of those people see Trump as a demigod
and they do whatever he does.

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:05.600
And if Trump goes to a mask facility and he
doesn't wear a mask, it encourages this exact

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.710
type of behavior that we don't need right
now.

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:09.069
So we can laugh it off.

00:02:09.069 --> 00:02:11.629
We can say, OK, you know, Trump wore goggles
and no mask.

00:02:11.629 --> 00:02:15.670
He's just personally kind of a weird dude
or an idiot, but it doesn't really have an

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:16.670
impact.

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:21.579
This will fuel more right wingers not wearing
masks and actually being opposed to them.

00:02:21.579 --> 00:02:25.889
This sends the message that wearing a mask
isn't that important, even when the policy

00:02:25.889 --> 00:02:29.370
of a location is masks at all times.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:34.010
It encourages people to ignore it if they
see Trump ignoring the policy that's in large

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:37.099
print on a TV and probably multiple he views.

00:02:37.099 --> 00:02:41.239
Trump's own administration has said covering
your mask is better than not cover covering

00:02:41.239 --> 00:02:44.599
your face, rather is better than not covering
your face.

00:02:44.599 --> 00:02:48.080
If you don't have a mask, wear a scarf, Trump
said.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.819
Well, they had masks.

00:02:49.819 --> 00:02:50.950
It's a mask factory.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:53.140
I would wear one if they require it.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:54.409
But then he doesn't.

00:02:54.409 --> 00:02:59.849
And of course, that puts people around Trump
at risk, and it puts Trump himself at risk.

00:02:59.849 --> 00:03:04.030
The message that is being sent is masks are
no big deal.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.859
Corona virus is no big deal.

00:03:05.859 --> 00:03:07.419
Everything's fine.

00:03:07.419 --> 00:03:12.430
And yet two thousand three hundred fifty people
died in the United States yesterday.

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:13.809
But remember, he's wearing goggles.

00:03:13.809 --> 00:03:17.709
This is the same guy who looked at a solar
eclipse directly.

00:03:17.709 --> 00:03:20.069
So it's not a question of Trump's intelligence.

00:03:20.069 --> 00:03:21.639
That seems to be lacking.

00:03:21.639 --> 00:03:24.349
But how does no one put a mask on the guy?

00:03:24.349 --> 00:03:27.230
And it's because of what we call management
by optics.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:31.620
OK, it's the optics of this is no big deal
and we won.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:37.139
If Trump hasn't been seen with a mask once
during the entire pandemic and he hasn't and

00:03:37.139 --> 00:03:41.469
then he claims we've basically won, we can
start taking apart the pandemic response.

00:03:41.469 --> 00:03:43.969
The White House Coronavirus Task Force, rather.

00:03:43.969 --> 00:03:48.129
If he then shows up with a mask for the first
time, the optics don't match.

00:03:48.129 --> 00:03:49.879
I admit that that's the case.

00:03:49.879 --> 00:03:51.819
If you're trying to say we won.

00:03:51.819 --> 00:03:55.640
You don't start wearing a mask on week nine
of the pandemic.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:04:23.370
This is management by optics, period.

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:45.900
And 
that

00:04:45.900 --> 00:05:01.430
is very dangerous.

